<description>&lt;p&gt;Colombian forces continued intensive operations, with a strike in Cauca eliminating ten ELN fighters and a separate operation killing ten more ELN rebels, while President De la Espriella confirmed the death of two ELN leaders. A drone strike in Guapi wounded four soldiers and killed one Marine, and a car bomb at Casanare toll booths injured four women. A powerful earthquake killed over 250 people, a mine collapse in Nariño killed 14 miners, and Santa Marta declared a red alert for flash floods. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNcDV2Ny1NcWRXTVVfZUh4SVNrbmZvbGVTZVlaZHBGeFpCVXg4bDVpczA2VmhkakI2X25OQ1FHaEY0SUg5NjFYUmdTX1A3QWZyWi15U2ZqVXJkeElFOXNLRjR0ejI1Sm10YU5ueHhZSnRnc25KeXN0T2RNNmpYRTJZRlN4cTBzVjNtdUQzTmR6c09FbW53TEswMGNR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Insider Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxQNG5TdjU4d1Y5Q2p3M0QyMXNaLThWWW5UaHItTHp0UjdiVmg5NHVsUUgxdUZtQjZNaXo1Q2VfZ2hFQ0xfaGE2RkxvRlEyZFRGd3lxQUhUOXRGenF2WC1TOTR1THZxVGlzdU1sc2M5NVBEVC1KeGxpeVJXaEcwVjZuaFNwTnJQa0ZuMXRPVXdOUUsxNFBqbi1BeGNkZjN6ZnRTSHE3NlBFUUZMTi1PQmczWkRma0RxV0pqdnNlWTN3aDVNOF9VUjJNbg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Justice For Colombia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE9rUWRDMGFYQS0wNXNLZUVTdC0ta3cySXdBQ0NhMFZmVFo0QVpScjhsbkpFMlR5Wm11dTVINTVpdFFHNkxTdnlXNmlGemtzZE5zb1RqMlladUFyUG9qdmstdm9WZmNObGR4QllQWHo4b25odw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Bureau | Sam Cooper&lt;/